// ============================================================
// FILE: TraderSellPopup.layout  (compact item-sell window, v4)
//
// Fixed v3 -> v4 after in-game feedback (odd small fonts and stray glyphs,
// 3D preview not scaling/centring like the buy window, SELL button drifted right):
//
//  * FONTS: only names that really exist in gui/fonts are used. The old
//    "gui/fonts/sdf_MetronBold24" does NOT exist (available SDF set is
//    sdf_metronbook24/72 and sdf_metronlight24/30/36/42/72) and that missing
//    font was the cause of the strange glyphs. Bold is now requested the vanilla
//    way: font sdf_MetronBook24 + "bold text" 1 (see examples/buttontemplate.layout).
//  * BUTTON: standard menu button look - style MenuDefault (62 vanilla uses),
//    FULL WIDTH, horizontally centred (halign center_ref + position.x 0) and
//    pinned to the bottom edge (valign bottom_ref + small negative y), the same
//    idea as day_z_ingamemenu.layout (full-width buttons) and
//    day_z_logout_dialog.layout (bottom_ref + fractions). The red overlay image
//    is gone: MenuDefault draws the real frame.
//  * FOOTER: three bands - price/amount on top, full-width slider in the middle,
//    full-width button at the bottom.
//  * 3D PREVIEW: inner ItemFrameWidget now uses the vanilla inspect values
//    (day_z_inventory_new_inspect.layout: position 0 -8.313, size 1 1.025,
//    hexactpos 1, hexactsize 0, halign/valign center_ref, "force flip enable" 1)
//    and the preview card is near square, so the model scales and centres the
//    same way as in the trader buy window (the script also copies the buy window
//    model position).
//
// Anchor rule (gui/layouts): position is an OFFSET FROM THE ANCHOR POINT chosen by
// halign/valign; units are px when hexactpos is 1, otherwise a fraction of that
// side of the parent. Negative offsets move the widget back inside.
// ============================================================
FrameWidgetClass rootFrame {
 clipchildren 1
 ignorepointer 0
 color 1 1 1 1
 position 0 0
 size 1 1
 hexactpos 0
 vexactpos 0
 hexactsize 0
 vexactsize 0
 priority 2
